<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE- Ingwe Coal yr shr leaps to 320 cts.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Ingwe Coal yr shr leaps to 320 cts.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		320.0	 vs 234.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 150.0	 vs 110.0</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of analysts forecast Ingwe's earnings per share rising by 41 percent to 329 cents from a previous 234 cents. The range was between 310-350 cents.</p>
<p>The dividend was seen up 43 percent to 157 cents from a range of 145 to 175 cents.</p>
</text>
